{\plain {\ulnone \i0 \b0 The }{\ulnone DFT
 has a number of properties that are useful
 in DSP applications. One property provides
 an alternative computation of the periodic
 convolution }{\ulnone \b (}{\b \ul 2.5}{\ulnone 
\b )}{\ulnone . When the DFT is implemented
 with a fast algorithm, the FFT, this leads
 to a fast algorithm for computing (2.5)
 that is very important to DSP.}}
}
.ATT
.STATUS Go to Section 2, p. 6
.GOTO 2_bk.mcd
.ATT_END
