{\plain {\b \ulnone Property 4.4: Periodic
 frequency translation}{  Given a DFT \{F}{\dn8 
k}{, k = 0,...,N-1\},     with IDFT \{f}{\dn8 
n}{\}, it has period N. Then, for any integer
 kd, the translated sequence      \{G}{\dn8 
k}{=F}{\dn8 k-kd}{\} is defined over indices
 k in \{0,...,N-1\} and we may compute its
 IDFT      \{g}{\dn8 n}{\}. We find that
 g}{\dn8 n}{ =ec}{\dn8 n,kd}{ f}{\dn8 n}{.}}
}
