{\plain {A}{n important use of the DFT in
 DSP is in providing a method of computing
 the periodic convolution that is alternative
 to the direct computation }{\ul \b (2.5)}{
 and that can be computationally }{more}{
 efficient. We establish this alternate 
computational method with the following 
Property.}}
}
.ATT
.STATUS Go to Section 2, p. 6
.GOTO 2_bk.mcd
.ATT_END
