}
{\plain {To establish this result, we use
 the definition }{\ul \b (3.4)}{ of the 
IDFT to express \par }{\{y}{\dn8 n}{, n 
= 0,...,N-1\} in terms of }{\{Y}{\dn8 k}{=X}{\dn8 
k}{ H}{\dn8 k}{\}. Then we use the definition
 }{\ul \b (3.3)}{ of the DFT to express 
\{X}{\fs16 \dn6 k}{\} and \{H}{\fs16 \dn6 
k}{\} in terms of, respectively, }{\{x}{\dn8 
n}{, n = 0,...,N-1\} and }{ \{h}{\dn8 n}{,
 n = 0,...,N-1\}. We then interchange orders
 of the three summations to get the interior
 sum in the form}}
}
.ATT
.STATUS Go to Section 3, p. 3
.GOTO 3_bk.mcd
.ATT_END
