{\f1\fnil Symbol;}
{\f2\fnil CG Times;}
}
{\plain {(ii) Define an N-periodic frequency
 response to be that of Example 3.7 except
 the factor exp[-i(2}{\f1 p}{/N)((M-1)/2)k]
 is replaced by unity. Compute and plot 
its IDFT, or N-periodic frequency response.
 Compare with your plot for (i). Carefully
 explain why we might call this filter noncausal.
 (Recall the discussion after }{\ul \b Problem
 2.5}{.)}}
